msgid "\"{segment}\" is a forbidden file or folder name."
msgstr "„{segment}“ on keelatud faili- või kausta nimi."

msgid "\"{segment}\" is a forbidden file type."
msgstr "„{segment}“ on keelatud failitüüp."

msgid "\"{segment}\" is not allowed inside a file or folder name."
msgstr "„{segment}“ pole faili- või kausta nimes lubatud."

msgid "{seconds} seconds left"
msgid_plural "{seconds} seconds left"
msgstr[0] "jäänud {seconds} sekund"
msgstr[1] "jäänud {seconds} sekundit"

#. TRANSLATORS time has the format 00:00:00
msgid "{time} left"
msgstr "aega jäänud {time} "

msgid "a few seconds left"
msgstr "jäänud mõni sekund"

msgid "All files"
msgstr "Kõik failid"

msgid "An item with the same name already exists in {dirname}."
msgstr "„{dirname}“ kaustas juba on olemas sama nimega objekt."

msgid "assembling"
msgstr "koostamisel"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Katkesta"

msgid "Cancel the entire operation"
msgstr "Katkesta kogu tegevus"

msgid "Cancel uploads"
msgstr "Katkesta üleslaadimine"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Jätka"

msgid "Create new"
msgstr "Loo uus"

msgid "estimating time left"
msgstr "hinnanguline järelejäänud aeg"

msgid "Existing files"
msgstr "Olemasolevad failid"

msgid ""
"Existing files and folders will be deleted if not selected. If both are "
"chosen, they will be renamed."
msgstr ""
"Kui nad just pole valitud, siis olemasolevad failid ja kaustad kustutatakse."
" Kui mõlemad on valitud, siis nende nimed muutuvad."

msgid "Existing version"
msgstr "Olemasolev versioon"

msgid "Failed to assemble the chunks together"
msgstr "Tükkide koostamine üheks tervikuks ei õnnestunud"

msgid "Failed to upload the file"
msgstr "Faili üleslaadimine ei õnnestunud"

msgid "Filenames must not end with \"{segment}\"."
msgstr "Failinime lõpus ei tohi olla „{segment}“."

msgid "Invalid filename"
msgstr "Vigane failinimi"

msgid ""
"Items with the same name already exist in {dirname}, select which to keep."
msgstr ""
"„{dirname}“ kaustas juba on olemas sama nimega objekte, vali mida tahad "
"neist säilitada."

msgid "Keep both"
msgstr "Säilita mõlemad"

msgid "Last modified date unknown"
msgstr "Viimase muutmise kuupäev pole teada"

msgid "New"
msgstr "Uus"

msgid "New filename"
msgstr "Uus failinimi"

msgid "New files"
msgstr "Uued failid"

msgid "New version"
msgstr "Uus versioon"

msgid "paused"
msgstr "pausil"

msgid "Rename"
msgstr "Muuda nime"

msgid "Replace"
msgstr "Asenda"

msgid "Select all checkboxes"
msgstr "Vali kõik märkeruudud"

msgid "Select file to keep"
msgstr "Vali säilitatav fail"

msgid "Select files to keep"
msgstr "Vali säilitatavad failid"

msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Jäta vahele"

msgid "Skip {count} file"
msgid_plural "Skip {count} files"
msgstr[0] "Jäta vahele {count} fail"
msgstr[1] "Jäta vahele {count} faili"

msgid "Unknown size"
msgstr "Tundmatu suurus"

msgid "Upload"
msgstr "Laadi üles"

msgid "Upload files"
msgstr "Laadi failid üles"

msgid "Upload folders"
msgstr "Laadi kaustad üles"

msgid "Upload from device"
msgstr "Laadi seadmest üles"

msgid "Upload has been cancelled"
msgstr "Üleslaadimine on katkestatud"

msgid "Upload has been skipped"
msgstr "Üleslaadimine on vahele jäetud"

msgid "Upload of \"{folder}\" has been skipped"
msgstr "„{folder}“ kausta üleslaadimine on vahele jäetud"

msgid "Upload progress"
msgstr "Üleslaadimise edenemine"

msgid ""
"When a new folder is selected, any conflicting files within it will also be "
"overwritten."
msgstr ""
"Kui uus kaust on valitud, siis seal asuvad vastuoluliste nimedega failid "
"kirjutatakse samuti üle."

msgid ""
"When a new folder is selected, the content is written into the existing "
"folder and a recursive conflict resolution is performed."
msgstr ""
"Kui uus kaust on valitud, siis sisu kirjutatakse olemasolevasse kausta ja "
"käivitatakse rekursiivne vastuolude haldus."

msgid ""
"You can either rename the file, skip this file or cancel the whole "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Sa võid kas faili nime muuta, ta vahele jätta või kogu tegevuse katkestada."

msgid "You need to select at least one version of each file to continue."
msgstr "Jätkamiseks pead valima vähemalt ühe versiooni igast failist."
